in November of 2018 rather because many of
you got out and voted a formal impeachment

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:54.030
inquiry resolution, which we got last week.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:04:00.680
It only passed the house because Democrats
won the house in the 2018 midterms.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:06.560
This is why we vote now as far as Trump expect
him to lose it on Twitter.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.950
Maybe he'll try to shut down government.

